  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 350°F (175°C).",
    "Spread the peanuts and pumpkin seeds on a baking sheet and roast for 10-12 minutes.",
    "In a skillet, heat the coconut oil over medium heat. Add the dark chocolate chips and stir until melted.",
    "Add the oregano, thyme, red chili flakes, cumin, garlic powder, salt, and cayenne pepper to the skillet and stir for 1 minute.",
    "Add the roasted peanuts and pumpkin seeds to the skillet and stir to combine.",
    "Warm the tortillas according to package instructions.",
    "Assemble the tacos by spooning the peanut mixture onto a tortilla and serving.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy!"
